### Template for a new Unilux language.
### Copy this file to locales/<code>.ftl (for example de.ftl or pt-BR.ftl),
### replace every {""} with the translation, and add the language to LANGS in crates/unilux-i18n/src/lib.rs.
### Keep every { $name } variable listed in the comment above a message.
### Numbers such as $count arrive as numbers, so a message can pick its plural:
###   { $count ->
###       [one] { $count } problem
###      *[other] { $count } problems
###   }
### Keys are ids: never rename one because its English text changed.

